      <h2>Solution: Website Redesign</h2>
      <br>
      <br>
      <p>Used plain, persuasive, and intuitive language, from page titles to footer copy, to help visitors make decisions confidently while keeping messaging consistent with Clearly&#39;s brand voice across all three markets. Refined microcopy throughout the site, including user flows, CTAs, error messages, modals, forms, and tooltips, for a more consistent, user-friendly interaction from page to page.</p>
