  <div class="example-grid">
    <div class="example-card">
      <div class="tag">Confirmation Messaging</div>
      <p>Added clear, highly visible confirmation messages after account changes, resetting a password, updating payment details, changing an address, so users always knew an action had succeeded.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="example-card">
      <div class="tag">Tooltip Copy</div>
      <p>Users were unsure how to locate their &quot;PD&quot; measurement for glasses prescriptions. Rather than a long explanation, a short tooltip with a link to a fuller blog article kept the interface simple without losing helpfulness.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="example-card">
      <div class="tag">Subscription Management</div>
      <p>For the contact lens auto-refill feature, added copy letting users choose a pause frequency (from one month to indefinite), plus reassurance that they&#39;d get a reminder email and their card wouldn&#39;t be charged unexpectedly.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="example-card">
      <div class="tag">Error Messaging</div>
      <p>Simplified login and file-upload error messages so users understood exactly what went wrong and how to fix it, rather than being left stuck.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

