    <div class="about-content">
      <h2>Results & Outcome</h2>
      <br>
      <br>
      <p>The redesign was delivered on time and well received by stakeholders across the organization. Priority landing pages retained and improved search visibility through the migration, and the launch was marked by a coordinated content moment reaching customers across blog, social, and email. The account portal gave customers a more consistent, self-service experience for managing orders, payments, and account details, directly addressing the friction points raised in user feedback and easing pressure on customer support.
      <br /><br />
      Working across both workstreams reinforced how content strategy, once set at the top (style guide, tone, structure), has to hold together consistently all the way down to a single tooltip, and how much cross-functional coordination, from SEO to design to customer support, that consistency actually takes.</p>
